WEBVTT

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:06.190
We're detecting a massive body at our destination.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.070
Approaching rapidly!

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:09.820
A massive body?

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.490
The enemy fleet is executing a fold!

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:22.210
Good one, Gramia.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:25.960
Shall we begin?

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:31.000
All turrets open fire toward the enemy ships immediately!

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:33.130
Fire!

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.300
The enemy folded?

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.020
They predicted our move?

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.690
So they're headed for Ragna?

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.130
We gotta hurry back!

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:49.900
Freyja!

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:52.040
Calm down.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.170
The stage isn't ours yet.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:55.360
Mikumo?

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:58.690
The only thing we need to focus on is singing.

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.920
Enemy Windermerean fleet de-folding!

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:14.080
That's the Protoculture ship?

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:16.380
Where's Macross Elysion?

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:24.520
May our wind blow on the battlefield.

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:39.530
Defense fleet to Macross Elysion.

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.300
We have yet to hear the song of the wind yet.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.250
I see.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:47.820
Our shot was right on the money.

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:51.960
The Elysion can't fold again for another 40 minutes.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.150
Deploy all units!

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:54.980
Roger!

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:57.090
Second aerial company, take off!

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.260
Fold chambers bypass complete.

00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:59.680
That old loser...

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:01.790
Progress report from area 3.

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.890
You've gotten better, Gramia.

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:06.590
Hull damage report!

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:08.900
The sound wave system was damaged.

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:14.490
The fold navigation had energy priority, 
which was why the barrier was breached.

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:15.400
Understood.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.210
Get on top of those repairs!

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:21.210
Can you reboot the amplifier systems?

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:24.230
Alas, it will take some time.

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:26.150
Please bear with it.

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:33.420
Your Majesty, without amplification, utilizing the song of the wind is nigh impossible.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:37.920
Without the song, the ship cannot reach its full potential either.

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:41.200
Ernest...

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:44.680
A worthy opponent indeed.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:47.340
Spatially converging waveform is above limit.

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:48.390
Detecting backflow at the bypass.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.760
Reboot the Zauberflöte.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:50.650
Hurry with the repairs.

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:53.060
The worst possible time...

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:58.740
Hold until the song of the wind resounds again!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.740
We must defend

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.800
the Sigur Valens!

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:06.620
De-fold activity detected?

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:10.120
They've arrived.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:14.230
Alpha, Beta, and Gamma Platoons, 
attack the enemy flagship!

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:15.040
Roger!

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:18.970
Delta Platoon! Keep the White Knight's group busy!

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:20.130
Roger!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:23.520
The enemy flagship has broken 
through our third defense line.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:25.540
It's entering the atmosphere!

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.600
Waiting is also a part of the job.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.100
B-But...

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:35.110
Keep yourself composed. We may need to dazzle the stage any moment.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:38.070
Okies!

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:42.890
Your operation seems to have failed.

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:47.400
As planned, we will detonate the reaction shaped charge.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:49.950
You might be better off pulling out.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.710
But all the civilians haven't been evacuated yet!

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.670
This is a NUNS operation.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:59.520
You have no word in the matter.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:07.740
Let's end this before the reaction bomb goes off!

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:08.660
Yeah!

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:11.020
The White Knight!

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:14.940
I'll be the decoy and distract him.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.500
Formation Uranos!

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:17.140
Okay!

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:18.440
Roger!

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:23.360
He dodged it!

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.240
He figured us out?

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.330
Then surround him!

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:31.600
A trap?!

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:32.040
What?!

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.340
Thanks!

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.630
Counting on you, Delta 2!

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:40.870
I know!

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:43.070
Get it together!

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:46.550
I'm here!

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.850
Stop hesitating and just fly the way you want to!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:51.600
It's not as easy as you make it sound!

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:56.850
The enemy flagship is approaching the underwater ruins.

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.910
It's expected to reach them soon.

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:05.020
They really are after the Protoculture's relics.

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:06.360
Keep them busy.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:13.410
<i>I fell in love staring into your eyes</i>

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:16.120
<i>I became obsessed and chased after you</i>

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:22.170
<i>I can't stop yet, I want to know more</i>

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.150
De-fold activity in orbit detected!

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:21.520
Soundwaves detected!

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:22.630
It's Walküre!

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:25.130
<i>The more I wish, the more I wonder</i>

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.130
Their tainted wind...

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:28.140
<i>The more I feel, the more I burn</i>

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:34.850
<i>And I continue deeper into the unknown</i>

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:40.940
<i>Everyone believes in dreams and love,</i>

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:36.140
Freyja!

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.060
Delta 4! Eight o'clock above you!

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:47.280
<i>But if you don't shoot for the stars, what's the point?</i>

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.660
<i>Love is all or nothing</i>

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.580
<i>It's an unreachable borderline</i>

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:50.780
Hayate!

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:59.420
<i>No matter how impossible it may be, it won't stop me</i>

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:54.160
Is this it?

00:05:58.660 --> 00:05:59.420
Now.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.510
<i>I'm going crazy</i>

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:02.590
Focus all barrier energy to the bilge!

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:06.840
<i>I'm losing my mind beyond my wildest imaginations</i>

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.480
Prepare for impact!

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:05.130
What?!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:10.600
<i>I can't control myself anymore</i>

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.330
What's going on?!

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:17.840
A reaction bomb?!

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:18.390
Your Majesty!

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.650
Heinz!

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.360
All units, retreat!

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.070
Fucking hell!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.040
Sis!

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:45.450
Run, Delta 4!

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:46.510
Delta 4!

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:48.670
Hayate!

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:09.450
Hayate!

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:16.330
Hayate!

00:07:17.090 --> 00:07:18.520
Pull yourself together!

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.090
Hayate!

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:22.810
Are you nuts?

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:26.640
That was ridiculous.

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:28.210
You could've died!

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:34.680
What kind of instructor would I be if I just watched my student die?

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:45.940
Thanks, Instructor Mirage.

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:53.530
We couldn't stop the reaction bomb.

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.910
But the Windermerean fleet got...

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:09.050
Is the royal family safe?!

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:16.560
The ruins absorbed the reaction 
bomb's energy and disappeared?

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:17.970
It would appear so.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:23.810
They would use weapons that taint their motherland without any hesitation.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:30.400
Earthlings indeed have no claim 
to the throne of the galaxy.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.140
Fold signals are increasing beneath the ship!

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:36.820
What?!

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:46.700
This waveform...

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:48.750
It's emerging from subspace?

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:52.970
So this is what the scientists were talking about?

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.770
We've got the data.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:56.090
Retreat immediately!

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.390
Roger!

00:08:57.710 --> 00:09:01.460
The flagship and the giant structure 
that appeared on the surface have linked

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:03.380
and commenced transferring of information!

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:08.880
This ship really was the key to 
establishing the Starwind sector.

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:11.070
Your Majesty.

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:13.510
I will sing the song of the wind.

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:16.030
I can feel a great power from that system.

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:20.310
This is the heritage of the Protoculture.

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:23.210
Sing, Heinz!

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:25.850
In the name of the true king!

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:28.420
Rudanjal Rom Mayan!

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:31.260
Rudanjal Rom Mayan!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:42.810
It's transforming?

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:44.810
The song of the wind is...

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:46.770
It's stronger than ever before.

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:51.860
Prince Heinz...

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:14.760
Major Arad!

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:17.340
SOS from the island ship!

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.060
This is Delta 1 to all units!

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:22.540
There is an emergency!

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.270
We're abandoning Ragna!

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.820
We're running away?!

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.480
Civilians have been affected by Var.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:33.570
If violence ensues, casualties will be sky-high.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:37.490
We'll suppress the Var with Walküre's singing

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:41.450
and bring in as many civilians 
as possible before we take off.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.910
Stand your ground until the evacuation's complete!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:44.660
Over!

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:49.110
I like that color.

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:50.330
Color?

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.830
Hayate?

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:54.340
Your passionate red horn!

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:57.880
It's not a horn, you perv!

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.330
I'll protect Walküre!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:03.810
But you got shot down.

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:05.070
Give me a break.

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:07.860
I expect a nice song from you!

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:11.220
Yeah. Not gonna let you down!

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:19.230
Let's get going, Vice-captain Mirage!

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:20.860
But you don't have a plane...

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:23.120
We have a spare.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.840
I'm borrowing her, Messer.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:39.530
<i>Kiss, kiss, feel love</i>

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:42.610
<i>Kiss, kiss, feel love</i>

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:48.560
<i>You can't reach the future if you never take off</i>

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:54.100
<i>Take me along to the end of space as you fly away</i>

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:58.320
<i>When I reach my hand out to you,</i>

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:05.320
<i>I hope you're going to pick me</i>

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:08.200
<i>My heart is beating loud</i>

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:07.100
This song...

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:08.200
It's Walküre!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:12.600
<i>Can you hear the song of life?</i>

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:10.350
Everyone! Listen!

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:14.330
As long as we can hear the songs of our galactic goddesses Walküre,

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:19.340
<i>I'm sure it means the beginning is tomorrow</i>

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:17.110
we won't go down without a fight!

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:25.340
<i>With love in our hearts, we spread this melody</i>

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:28.160
Ragna island ship ascending!

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:30.560
<i>As our blue star guides me to you</i>

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:31.350
The enemy is already running.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:36.490
<i>I'm still here, singing about our dream</i>

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:34.460
The wind of victory is in our sails!

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:37.860
However, we cannot allow threats to persist.

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:41.860
<i>Come, it's time to spread our wings together</i>

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.860
We shall annihilate Walküre.

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:44.320
<i>The solitude of tomorrow</i>

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:48.480
Alpha, Beta, Gamma, and all defense platoons: 
protect the island ship and Aether at all costs!

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:46.750
<i>must stay my secret</i>

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:50.350
<i>As I take your hand</i>

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:52.030
Delta Platoon, focus your assault 
on the White Knight's group!

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:55.500
<i>and fall with you into the abyss</i>

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:55.500
Protect the civilians and Walküre until the evacuation is complete!

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.230
Roger!

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:57.430
Aye, sir!

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:09.720
<i>I break you free of the darkness in your eyes</i>

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:15.060
<i>My stolen heart is flying away</i>

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:19.230
<i>The sight so dreadful when I was alone</i>

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:19.820
This wind!

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:26.460
<i>seems lovely now that you're with me</i>

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:22.360
You're not worthy of that plane!

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:28.910
<i>My heart is beating loud</i>

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:33.150
<i>You're my love and mine only</i>

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:33.560
Delta 4, formation Hallman!

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:39.790
<i>If it's some strength that we need, perhaps I can help</i>

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:34.290
Okay!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.290
I reached you!

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:36.870
He accelerated?

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:38.130
He's returning to the enemy fleet?

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.790
Not so fast!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:42.670
Don't lose him!

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:49.090
Dammit! He can fly so steadily in this wind?!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:51.350
What?!

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.820
Let's keep at it, Rei-Rei.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:02.360
Yeah.

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:05.320
This wind... He's risking his life.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:06.910
At this rate...

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:08.780
Our song won't reach them!

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:11.870
Delta 4! Behind you!

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:14.300
Run, Delta 4!

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:15.410
Hayate!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:16.460
Hayate?

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:22.190
You rotting apples! I'm gonna bury you all today!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.810
Gotcha!

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:37.520
Freyja!

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:42.270
Freyja!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:43.480
Delta 4!

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:46.680
Enemy carrier's sound fold waves silenced!

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:50.700
Sync between our ship and the emerged Protoculture structure has stabilized!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.680
It is going according to plan.

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:59.260
Our ship's weapon system, the true power of the Protoculture, is awakening.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:00.550
Very well.

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:02.650
All ships, prepare to fire.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:04.750
Target is the enemy carrier!

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:14.670
Are you all okay?

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:15.770
Alive, at least.

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:17.760
Mikumo!

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:19.480
This is nothing.

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:28.110
Not today!

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:32.070
Don't stop!

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:34.700
Full speed ahead!

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.380
Captain!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.210
The Elysion?

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:52.640
We can't—

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:53.840
Mikumo!

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.870
You're hurt!

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:57.180
There are bigger things to worry about.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:02.560
Hayate?

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:06.190
I have to reach him!

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:09.190
My song has to reach him!

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.830
Rune, rune...

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:11.650
Rune, rune...

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:12.700
Huh?

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:13.220
Rune, rune...

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:13.630
Freyja?

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.490
Rune... Rune...

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:16.700
Rune, rune...

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.290
Rune flash!

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:20.040
Here comes that rune!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:21.670
Freyja!

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:23.170
What is she thinking?!

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:26.220
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:28.840
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:32.730
<i>Let's share a selfish kiss</i>

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:37.850
Hayate!

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:43.600
<i>The petals of this flower fall in the wind</i>

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:48.940
<i>The stars are more than I could count</i>

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:46.690
Freyja!

00:16:47.510 --> 00:16:48.940
Flying girl...

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.800
She's risking her life...

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:52.400
<i>I could place all the blame on you,</i>

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:52.400
She wants her song to reach him.

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:55.110
<i>swallowing back my tears,</i>

00:16:55.110 --> 00:17:00.230
<i>but I can't tell anyone about how my heart races</i>

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:58.970
Freyja!

00:16:58.970 --> 00:16:59.740
She's flying.

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:02.910
<i>(Reach out)</i>

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:03.330
<i>Until it all breaks apart</i>

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.080
Everyone!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:05.000
<i>(Reach out)</i>

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.850
<i>Until you can take flight</i>

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:08.380
<i>(To the ends)</i>

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:09.340
<i>Deep in my heart</i>

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.900
<i>(Of time)</i>

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:11.590
<i>There is a prayer</i>

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:14.630
<i>Just feel, just believe</i>

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:18.750
<i>and speed through it all</i>

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:21.930
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.430
This song...

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.350
Freyja?!

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:24.600
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:24.600
What are you...

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:30.320
<i>Let's share a kiss faster than light, just wait for me</i>

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:26.200
I reached you!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.480
Freyja!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:33.170
<i>I'll leave my body behind</i>

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:35.820
<i>I'll leave my heart beating hard</i>

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:41.400
<i>I'll break free from these chains holding me down</i>

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:37.570
Heinz!

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:40.220
Wh-What's going on?

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:41.740
It's that apple girl!

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:47.460
<i>Just come get me, in my purest form</i>

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:43.750
Freyja?

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:44.870
Freyja!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.920
Freyja!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.300
White Knight!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:55.420
<i>When the lightning scorches the heavens</i>

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.210
Freyja!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.180
Delta 4!

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:55.420
Leave her to me!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:18:00.930
<i>my passion flares up</i>

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:59.050
You fly to your heart's content!

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.930
Take down the White Knight!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:07.100
<i>and I am reminded that heart and body are one</i>

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:04.330
Thanks, Mirage!

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:05.680
I'll leave Freyja to you!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:12.300
<i>It's a listlessness I can't describe</i>

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:11.690
Freyja!

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:14.440
<i>(We)</i>

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:14.440
Mirage!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:15.500
<i>met</i>

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:17.150
<i>(We)</i>

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:18.520
<i>looked for each other</i>

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.910
<i>(In the darkness)</i>

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:19.910
The wind's changed?

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:21.120
<i>of space bloomed</i>

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:22.660
I can read his movements!

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:22.660
<i>(Our)</i>

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:23.710
<i>shining flower of fire</i>

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:27.870
<i>Shoot through my heart with the light of stars</i>

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:26.120
Dimensional barrier dispersed!

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:30.290
<i>Bang! Bang! Bang!</i>

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:33.150
<i>Let's dance in your dream</i>

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:32.250
Oh?

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:35.920
<i>to our raging love</i>

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:41.430
<i>Let's embrace and hold each higher up than the sky</i>

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:38.930
Freyja!

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:40.840
Mirage!

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:44.390
<i>False strength</i>

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:46.890
<i>Meaningless bonds</i>

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:46.890
Walküre's singing!

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:52.400
<i>Cast it aside and live with me</i>

00:18:52.400 --> 00:19:00.350
<i>Just take me, bind me, you can do it</i>

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:58.030
Enemy vessel surfaced!

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:58.780
What?!

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:03.700
Not half bad, Captain!

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.700
Let's do this, Gramia!

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:09.340
You're not getting in my way, Ernest!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.100
No chance!

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:24.570
<i>Don't forget the urges that course through you</i>

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:25.890
<i>It's your time</i>

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:31.380
<i>Come for me as fast as you can</i>

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:34.560
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:37.300
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.190
The wind!

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:42.700
<i>Let's share a kiss faster than light, just wait for me</i>

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:42.700
He dodged it?

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:45.730
<i>I'll leave my body behind</i>

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.240
It feels great!

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.540
<i>I'll leave my heart beating hard</i>

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:53.930
<i>I'll break free from these chains holding me down</i>

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:53.210
He's using my wind!

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:56.460
<i>Just come get me, in my purest form</i>

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:57.160
<i>Hayate's flying differently now.</i>

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:59.610
<i>Let's dance in your dream</i>

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:00.970
<i>Is it because of Freyja's song?</i>

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:02.470
<i>to our raging love</i>

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:08.080
<i>Let's embrace and hold each higher up than the sky</i>

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:10.850
<i>False strength</i>

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:13.480
<i>Meaningless bonds</i>

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:19.100
<i>Cast it aside and live with me</i>

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:25.490
<i>Just take me, bind me, you can do it</i>

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:37.630
Damages to the ship moderate.

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.590
Cruising capabilities unaffected.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:42.200
No need to further pursue the enemy.

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:45.300
Focus on consolidating with the Protoculture structure!

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.530
No pursuers detected.

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:51.110
Apart from some of the Delta Platoon, all units have docked.

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:53.770
Very well.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.260
All ships, retreat!

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:57.230
Prepare for emergency fold!

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:12.120
Ragna....

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:14.870
Our blue planet.

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:19.710
We'll definitely be back.

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:37.650
Mission 13: Passionate Diving

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:45.130
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

00:22:45.780 --> 00:22:47.500
Wake up, Your Majesty!

00:22:48.290 --> 00:22:50.380
H-Hein...

00:22:57.330 --> 00:22:58.940
Your Majesty!

00:22:58.940 --> 00:22:59.810
Father!

00:23:15.530 --> 00:23:17.740
To all forces!

00:23:17.740 --> 00:23:21.210
In accordance with His Majesty's last will, I will assume command.

00:23:22.500 --> 00:23:30.930
I, on behalf of the Windermere Kingdom, hereby 
announce the completion of the Starwind sector!

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:39.600
Next time: Embracing Adrift
